oration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;">And honestly… the biggest lesson?</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Oxygen, Cantarell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Oxygen, Cantarell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;"> Good spacing, a simple type scale, and a clean flow can fix almost any messy screen.</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Ubunt